<title>USA: ALPINE SKIING-JAGGE WINS SLALOM.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-JAGGE WINS SLALOM.</headline>
<dateline>VAIL, Colorado 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finn Chr. Jagge of Norway won the men's slalom on Sunday, the last race of the World Cup season.</p>
<p>Thomas Stangassinger of Austria finished second and Alberto Tomba of Italy was third, according to provisional results.</p>
<p>The results were later declared official.</p>
</text>
